{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/extras/b4a4b5e66c253e93f8889b62c1ee9e2b.avif?t=1771528343\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/extras_big/b4a4b5e66c253e93f8889b62c1ee9e2b.avif?t=1771528343 width=800 height=208 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1878. An alternate steampunk reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Flood has swallowed everything. The world turned into an endless ocean. The survivors have learned to create mobile islands - 'Isla Muvimi' for trade and communication.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have to travel across the vast seas in search of the mythical continent. Battles at sea and in the air, mysteries of the underwater depths and the search for allies await the player in order to survive in this difficult world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/extras/7da8df52d7cc55c1296f73b4bc0eff0a.poster.avif?t=1771528343\" width=1170 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/extras/7da8df52d7cc55c1296f73b4bc0eff0a.webm?t=1771528343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/extras/7da8df52d7cc55c1296f73b4bc0eff0a.mp4?t=1771528343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and develop your mobile island - 'Isla Movimi' - and take it on an endless journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/extras/91bfd71e54dafd43b5c12c00f3e9f012.avif?t=1771528343\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/extras_big/91bfd71e54dafd43b5c12c00f3e9f012.avif?t=1771528343 width=800 height=208 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage your floating base island.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your battle turrets, plane and bathyscaphe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the vastness of the ocean, battle enemies and search for amazing secrets in the world of Sea Walker Saga.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting plot inspired by the movie 'Waterworld' starring Kevin Costner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main character grows stronger and smarter as he gains experience with the player.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/extras/eebf77df69b0b334ed890fae980bfff1.poster.avif?t=1771528343\" width=800 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/extras/eebf77df69b0b334ed890fae980bfff1.webm?t=1771528343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/extras/eebf77df69b0b334ed890fae980bfff1.mp4?t=1771528343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3169360?t=1771528343","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/033361ae256d802106f253cd5a8156e616d9c067/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771528343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/0c0184d1a00165a4036ed07fecd4272f3503112f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771528343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3169360/0c0184d1a00165a4036ed07fecd4272f3503112f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771528343","categories":[{"descript